  "answer": "Bill Brown 从 **杜克大学（Duke University）** 获得 B.A. 学位；他之后在斯坦福大学获得创意写作硕士学位，并在该校的 Modern Thought and Literature 项目获得博士学位。\n\n依据：\n- https://fragments.dbpedia.org/2015-10/en?object=%22Bill%20Brown...（DBpedia 条目：“Brown has a B.A. from Duke University, an M.A. in Creative Writing (poetry) from Stanford University, and a Ph.D. from Stanford University's Modern Thought and Literature program.”）\n- https://english.uchicago.edu/index%2Ephp/people/bill-brown（芝加哥大学英语系页面，可确认他的身份与任教学院）",
